  "description": "Add a colorful touch of love to your next embroidery project with this Rainbow Heart Embroidery Design! 🌈❤️ Featuring a beautiful layered rainbow arch with a heart in the center and charming floating hearts around it, this design has a cute, cheerful, and romantic look.\nPerfect for Valentine’s Day, love-themed projects, kids’ clothing, couples, gifts, T-shirts, hoodies, sweatshirts, tote bags, pillows, blankets, and personalized items.\n✨ Perfect For:\nValentine’s Day • Love & Romance Projects • Couples • Kids’ Projects • T-Shirts • Hoodies • Sweatshirts • Tote Bags • Pillows • Blankets • Jackets • Personalized Gifts\nCompatible with Brother, Baby Lock, Janome, Bernina, Husqvarna Viking, Singer, and most embroidery machines.\nThis is a digital embroidery file only. No physical product will be shipped.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a colorful touch of love to your next embroidery project with this Rainbow Heart Embroidery Design! 🌈❤️ Featuring a beautiful layered rainbow arch with a heart in the center and charming floating hearts around it, this design has a cute, cheerful, and romantic look.</p>\n<p>Perfect for Valentine’s Day, love-themed projects, kids’ clothing, couples, gifts, T-shirts, hoodies, sweatshirts, tote bags, pillows, blankets, and personalized items.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect For:<br>\nValentine’s Day • Love &amp; Romance Projects • Couples • Kids’ Projects • T-Shirts • Hoodies • Sweatshirts • Tote Bags • Pillows • Blankets • Jackets • Personalized Gifts</p>\n<p>Compatible with Brother, Baby Lock, Janome, Bernina, Husqvarna Viking, Singer, and most embroidery machines.<br>\nThis is a digital embroidery file only. No physical product will be shipped.</p>",
